---
// No equivalent section in the template — built in its visual language on
// the hull (dark navy) tone.
---

<section id="vision-mission">
  <div class="diag-divider diag-divider--hull" aria-hidden="true" />
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="section-heading">Where we are going</h1>

    <div class="row vm-block reveal">
      <div class="col-md-8 col-md-offset-2">
        <p class="vm-label">Vision</p>
        <p class="vm-text vm-lead">
          To be the most trusted technology company in Philippine online
          entertainment and gaming, the one that partners choose because our
          systems hold, our records are clean, and our standards do not move
          when nobody is watching.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row vm-block reveal">
      <div class="col-md-8 col-md-offset-2">
        <p class="vm-label">Mission</p>
        <p class="vm-text">
          We build, run, and support technology for online entertainment and
          gaming businesses to a standard that partners and customers can
          rely on. We do this by engineering our own technology rather than
          renting it, by developing Filipino talent into specialists in a
          field that has few of them, and by treating security, data
          protection, and reliability as the foundation of the business
          rather than a cost of doing it. Every system we build is made to be
          reviewed, and every team we run is trained to expect it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #vision-mission {
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 6em 0;
  }

  .vm-block {
    margin-top: 56px;
  }

  .vm-label {
    font-family: "Oswald", sans-serif;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    font-size: 0.9em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .vm-text {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1.1em;
    line-height: 1.6em;
  }

  .vm-lead {
    font-size: 1.35em;
    line-height: 1.5em;
  }
</style>
